    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109282" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποσῡρ-ίζω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποσῡρ-ίττω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>whistle, rustle,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰθὴρ . . πτερύγων ῥιπαῖς ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					126
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); <i>make a whistling sound,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἀρτηρία . . ὑπεσύριζε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					7.25
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				7
			</span></i>, al.; of snakes, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				2.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>make a signal by whistling,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aristaenet.
				2.4
			</span></i>.</div>
